      "verified_by": "a_status_flags_fit_uint8",
      "fine_trace_step": 3,
      "description": "Root cause. The legacy superblock parser accepts a 4-byte status word whose high bytes are nonzero because the only range check is a debug-only `HDassert`. In release builds the malformed 32-bit value is truncated to one byte and parsing continues on attacker-controlled legacy superblock state that should have been rejected."
    },
